🌍 A New World Opens: VELMORT! 🌍

📜 The chronicles of Rappelz turn a new page. The gates to the mysterious and untamed world of VELMORT have opened! There are no kings or heroes here—yet. But who knows? Maybe you will etch your name into the legends of this world. ✍👑

⚔ VELMORT offers:
✨ A world where everyone starts from scratch;
🔥 Pure PvP madness with equal chances;
🧙 Crowds of adventurers in the starting zones, just like the good old days;
🌌 That unmistakable Rappelz atmosphere—where everything depends on you.

🚫 This server leaves no room for old dominance:
❌ No 250+ level veterans;
❌ No overpowered pets from day one;
❌ No “golden elite” that bought out everything in advance;
❌ No rigged economy for insiders.

🏹 VELMORT is a chance for everyone to:
🤝 Form a party,
🗺 Explore dungeons,
🏰 Found a guild,
⚔ And fight for power at the Cursed Temple.

🌟 Everything is ahead. Everything is possible.
🔥 You stand at the beginning of a new world—go make your legend.

🛡 VELMORT awaits heroes. Are you ready to become one of them?

Heroes of the world of Gaia!

We are pleased to inform you about the opening of a new game world - “Haeron”! This means you have the opportunity to start the game on the same level as everyone else, on a new server with a pristine economy!
Beginners and battle-savvy warriors alike will be able to start their journey in Rappelz from scratch, fighting side by side with monsters, banding together and competing for a place on the leaderboards!

What's available on the Haeron server:
⭐fanning with players of your level;
⭐ party hockey in dungeons like we used to have;
⭐ lots of people in starting locations;
⭐ a nice breeze of nostalgia.

What the Haeron server doesn't have:
⭐established tops;
⭐ “folders” that will keep you from swinging;
⭐ high-level pets (and tame pets in general!);
⭐inflation;

❗The Haeron server runs on a PvP model.

Level up and get the best equipment first on the server, create powerful guilds, fight for dominance at the entrance to the Cursed Temple and the right to own the dungeon!

We wish everyone who decided to start their adventures in the new game world “Haeron”, success and heroic victories!

